Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/libtests/pngvalid.c
Line: 2207
Function: chromaticity_y
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: Returns c.Y / (c.X + c.Y + c.Z) without checking if the denominator is zero; if X=Y=Z=0, this divides by zero.

Source context:
